-while layer L computes (host double buffer), so per layer the cost is
-~max(export, H2D + GEMM). Measured on this host (E22a): export 68 ms/layer at
-52 GB/s (core-bound, scales with KT_CPUINFER), H2D 37 ms to both cards,
-pipelined ~87 ms/layer; vs ~19 s/layer-chunk on the CPU path at 4096 tokens.
